{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.haruki.second",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "演出结束后，她从台上追了出来",
  "status": "approved",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.haruki.second",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.haruki.second",
    "idolId": "haruki",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "text": "舞台那边掌声散了。收拾器材的人来人往。",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（演得挺开心的样子，太好了）",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "那个……！",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你、你从舞台上……！！",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "跑下来了",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "舞台是结束了没错……不过直接跑过来这边──",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "是……一想到以后可能就见不到了，就忍不住──",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……我看到，世界开始有颜色了。",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "请把我，带走吧……！",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……！",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……我是做偶像制作人的。你如果有兴趣的话──",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "text": "递出名片。她盯着看了很久。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……好像，是的呢",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "啊、那个。其实刚才聊了一下，有件事忘了说……！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "text": "（其实她只是想说那句\"带我走\"）",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……要不要来事务所坐坐？",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "可以吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。就当是听你聊聊，画画、乐队、映像部，什么都可以。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "haruki",
        "text": "……好！"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
